  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-09-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第9题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-09",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25浙江）小李开车从静止开始匀加速行驶10分钟后，再匀速行驶20分钟，然后开始第二次匀加速行驶13.5千米。已知两次匀加速行驶总距离与匀速行驶距离相等，那么匀速行驶的速度是多少千米/小时？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "54"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "63"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "72"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "81"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          79
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          73
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-09-p079.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（二） · 实战精刷9 · 讲义第73页",
            "pdfPage": 79
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-09-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设匀速速度v千米/小时。前10分钟从静止加速，路程＝(v/2)×(1/6)＝v/12；中间匀速20分钟，路程v/3。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两段加速总路程与匀速段相等，所以v/12＋13.5＝v/3，得到v/4＝13.5，v＝54，选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "题目只问中间匀速速度时，第二次加速的细节可以不求，直接用总路程关系。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
